  "notes": [
    "Starting cards as posted under 'Start (8)': Bring Him Before Me / Take Your Father's Place, Death Star II: Throne Room (posted 'Throne Room'), Insignificant Rebellion, Your Destiny, Prepared Defenses, Imperial Arrest Order (posted 'IAO'), Mobilization Points (posted 'Mob Points') and Crush The Rebellion; these count toward the 60 (total 60 as published). Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
    "Section headers ('Locales (4)', 'Guys (23)', etc.) are not cards.",
    "Posted 'Palpatine' dested Emperor Palpatine (Death Star II; Senator Palpatine is a later card); 'DLOTS' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'EPP Fett' Boba Fett With Blaster Rifle; 'ECC IG-88' IG-88 With Riot Gun; 'ECC 4LOM' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle; 'EJP Dengar' Dengar With Blaster Carbine; 'Dr. E and Bob' Dr. Evazan & Ponda Baba.",
    "Posted 'Snoova's Stick' dested the Dark Vibro-Ax; 'Vader's Stick' Vader's Lightsaber; 'Mara's Stick' Mara Jade's Lightsaber; 'Bossk' and 'Zuckuss' under Ships dested Bossk In Hound's Tooth and Zuckuss In Mist Hunter.",
    "Posted 'DS2 Dockbay' dested Death Star II: Docking Bay; 'Cloud City Dockbay' Cloud City: East Platform (Docking Bay) (the Dark Cloud City docking bay); 'Endor Dockbay' the Dark Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay).",
    "Posted 'Barrier' dested Imperial Barrier; 'Ommni/Worse' Ommni Box & It's Worse; 'Hell2Pay' There'll Be Hell To Pay; Secret Plans is the Effect in 2001 (not a Defensive Shield).",
    "Byline gives only the initial 'R.'; filed as R. Smith with no player page, as for his other DeckTech posts."
